    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adding the furniture, decorations, and different types of employees you want in the menu, create the mall layout you want, purchase brand permission, and enhance the popularity of the mall. Enjoy the wonderful reaction between pixel customers and the scene you set up. At the same time, be ware of facing the trouble of thieves and saboteurs who will make a mess of the mall. Balance between serving customers and preventing bad guys to find the best mall layout for you. At the same time, pay attention to the limitation of money. In the early stage, your money is quite limited and you cannot be extravagant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/8e41f34c134ead8c5eb36609322d4b28.poster.avif?t=1741335909\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/8e41f34c134ead8c5eb36609322d4b28.webm?t=1741335909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/8e41f34c134ead8c5eb36609322d4b28.mp4?t=1741335909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the facilities you want and add missing kitchenware, containers, or tables and chairs according to game prompts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/c5ccc09332aaf6f194a0b936b1f32f5d.poster.avif?t=1741335909\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/c5ccc09332aaf6f194a0b936b1f32f5d.webm?t=1741335909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/c5ccc09332aaf6f194a0b936b1f32f5d.mp4?t=1741335909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add employees to operate your managed store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/599b5ac6657825d7d3dc0cb5aa8200ac.poster.avif?t=1741335909\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/599b5ac6657825d7d3dc0cb5aa8200ac.webm?t=1741335909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/599b5ac6657825d7d3dc0cb5aa8200ac.mp4?t=1741335909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adding the furniture, decorations, and different types of employees you want in the menu, create the mall layout you want, purchase brand permission, and enhance the popularity of the mall. Enjoy the wonderful reaction between pixel customers and the scene you set up. At the same time, be ware of facing the trouble of thieves and saboteurs who will make a mess of the mall. Balance between serving customers and preventing bad guys to find the best mall layout for you. At the same time, pay attention to the limitation of money. In the early stage, your money is quite limited and you cannot be extravagant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/8e41f34c134ead8c5eb36609322d4b28.poster.avif?t=1741335909\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/8e41f34c134ead8c5eb36609322d4b28.webm?t=1741335909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/8e41f34c134ead8c5eb36609322d4b28.mp4?t=1741335909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the facilities you want and add missing kitchenware, containers, or tables and chairs according to game prompts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/c5ccc09332aaf6f194a0b936b1f32f5d.poster.avif?t=1741335909\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/c5ccc09332aaf6f194a0b936b1f32f5d.webm?t=1741335909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/c5ccc09332aaf6f194a0b936b1f32f5d.mp4?t=1741335909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add employees to operate your managed store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/599b5ac6657825d7d3dc0cb5aa8200ac.poster.avif?t=1741335909\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/599b5ac6657825d7d3dc0cb5aa8200ac.webm?t=1741335909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519030/extras/599b5ac6657825d7d3dc0cb5aa8200ac.mp4?t=1741335909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
